Neighbors,

Two quick things from the association:

1. Fall block party: Sunday, October 11, 3-6pm on Rand Ave (closed to traffic). Potluck as usual; the sign-up sheet is on the website. Kids' bike parade at 4.

2. Street sweeping on the lake side moves from the 2nd Tuesday to the 2nd Wednesday starting in October. The city says the signs will be swapped by the end of the month; until then, watch for the paper notices.

Minutes from the September meeting are posted. Next meeting is Tuesday, October 6 at the library branch.

- GLN steering committee
